OL,3,GNEWSACrowd backs popular singer after
OL,4,Awelfare check
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of people gathered outside a
OL,7,Fconvenience store to show support for a
OL,8,Fbeloved local singer after a police
OL,9,Fwelfare check left him fearing he would
OL,10,Fno longer be able to perform.
OL,12,FMiles Green, 28, who has Down's
OL,13,Fsyndrome, has been a familiar sight for
OL,14,Fthe last 10 years, singing on a street
OL,15,Fcorner outside the One Stop store on
OL,16,FGedling Road, Carlton, where passing
OL,17,Fmotorists regularly sound their horns
OL,18,Fin encouragement.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
PN,36902
