OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1793357765
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSACrowd backs popular singer after
OL,4,Awelfare check
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut after officers were called over
OL,7,Fconcerns for his welfare, customers and
OL,8,Fsupportive strangers rallied round on
OL,9,FThursday for a singalong, encouraging
OL,10,Fthe local star to "shine brighter".
OL,12,FHe told the BBC seeing the support made
OL,13,Fhim emotional, and vowed to not stop
OL,14,Fsinging.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
